{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_27","type":"agent_message","text":"The storefront concept is set: a small “Night Shift Club” drop for people who like timestamps, terminal culture, and being awake when the rest of the world is asleep. I also verified a live Prodigi sandbox tee SKU (`TEE-GIL-64000`) and its required front print area, so the fulfillment payload can be concrete instead of a placeholder. I’m adding one original print asset now, then I’ll wire the full checkout flow around it."}}
